OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain will be patchy this
OL,6,Fmorning, turning heavier and more
OL,7,Fpersistent for a time through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Feeling unpleasant with
OL,9,Fstrong, potentially gale force winds
OL,10,Ftowards the coast and over hills,
OL,11,Fadding to the chilly feel.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA chilly night to come.
OL,14,FTurning drier overnight with clear
OL,15,Fspells developing further east,
OL,16,Fallowing temperatures to drop off.
OL,17,FStrong winds persist towards the coast
OL,18,Fand over hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
