OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FIt will remain dry through
OL,6,FWednesday, with some sunny spells
OL,7,Fpossible through the day and easing
OL,8,Fwinds. Though still feeling chilly.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,11,FBrighter on Thursday, turning wet and
OL,12,Fwindy from the west overnight. Rain
OL,13,Fmay turn to snow over the Pennines on
OL,14,FFriday. Another wet day on Saturday,
OL,15,Fbut with easing winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
